    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d259">

                <pb facs="0433" n="403" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54Guat/pg403"/>

                <head>259. Telegram From Operation PBSUCCESS Headquarters in Florida to the Mission
                    Broadcasting Station<anchor n="1" xml:id="d259-f1"/></head>
                <dateline>[<hi rendition="#italic">place not declassified</hi>], <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1954-06-29T16:31:00+00:00">June 29, 1954,
                        1631Z</date>.</dateline>
                <p>4515. Re: LINC 4510.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d259-f2"/> For Cadick.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Do not be influenced by cry of hoax as we shall retain power of
                        retaliation until Calligeris position is secure. [<hi rendition="#italic">2
                            lines of source text not declassified</hi>] Regret we unable to fully
                        inform you of every detail therefore you must keep confidence throughout
                        this difficult period.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Your complete compliance to ref msg is mandatory.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Modification of use of A/C: You may re-supply field forces to extent
                        necessary to maintain effectiveness while awaiting final decision. <pb
                            facs="0434" n="404" xml:id="pg404"/> Use armed fighter A/C for recon for
                        defensive purposes. Instruct air and ground to be particularly alert for
                        withdrawal enemy units to Adam as such action would violate cease-fire
                        principle of troops in place. Important that enemy not take advantage of
                        cease-fire in any way. Report violations before taking action.</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Clear all plans and significant actions with LINC until further
                        notice.</item>
                    <label>5.</label>
                    <item>Report your compliance ref msg soonest.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
